followed all the howto's on decompiling and recompiling the DSDT and
applied some of the fixes to the errors that came up, but LID and POW
events are still not detected and sleep and suspend don't work properly
either. If someone with greater knowledge of ACPI would be willing to
work with me I'd be very much appreciative (as would many other 5150
Linux users). If your willing just give me a list of what you would need
to effectively troubleshoot and I'll get right on it.




